      },
      "message": "test(app): expect the creation order after undo of delete_setup\n\nPR #3485 (#3447) made the setup order the creation order. The MCP test\nstill asserted the old name order [\"Back\",\"Front\"] after the undo of\ndelete_setup. Front was created first, so the restored order is\n[\"Front\",\"Back\"]. The test now captures the setup list before the\ndelete and asserts that each undo restores exactly that list.\n\nFixes #3602\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
